{"ID":"20240513083305-qzxauyd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083305-qzxauyd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083305-qzxauyd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513131253-2bnjcxs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513131253-2bnjcxs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:471,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513131253-2bnjcxs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:497,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:648\u0026#125;","title":"105","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513131253-2bnjcxs","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1102px;","id":"20240513131253-2bnjcxs","updated":"20240515123345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"082-3 V, M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"08/05/16"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n尿毒治療中，回診"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 已經兩周沒洗腎了，無頭暈，噁心現象"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 半夜咳嗽無痰，吸入困難"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 睡：好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 小便很好：有便意且有力，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腎陽已回來"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 胃口好，無噁心"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 已經沒有尿毒到心臟"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 口渴有，喜冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 雙足溫手溫，額涼："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"陽潛入陰，陰陽趨向於常態"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 大便每日一二行"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 汗：無 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心臟功能尚未完全恢復"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪而有力 夏天脈"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳孔仍較大腎陽尚未完全回來， 有縮收了，比以前好很多，心區白心陽不足"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人進步中，半夜呼吸短促，咳嗽無痰，因天陽無法入腎，吸入困難"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.同2/22方 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢 白芍六錢 炙甘草五錢 黨參三錢 生薑二片 杏仁三錢 柴胡三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鬱金六錢 川芎二錢 當歸三錢 黃芩三錢 熟地二錢 澤瀉五錢 茯苓五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白朮三錢 黃耆五錢 杜仲三錢 補骨脂三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"增加：黃連3錢，川芎3錢，覆盆子3錢，炮附子5錢， 麻黃3錢   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗 服時加麥芽糖一匙 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. HT-48桂附八味丸 302 午飯前即睡前服 每次30粒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1.腎衰竭病人腎中寒水反逆至胃，會導致噁心嘔吐；反逆至中膈會導致暈眩。目前無頭暈，噁心現象，表示腎陽回頭，尿毒已解"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2． 半夜呼吸短促，咳嗽無痰吸入困難，因肺的原陽無法入腎，使用麻黃就是為了開啟肺的原陽使金能生水，炮附子，覆盆子加強腎陽，以加強腎納氣的功能。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"3． 黃連可以解掉尿毒到心臟的毒害，並鞏固療效"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}